# Line endings for the agent harness.
#
# GATE-I18N compares `git hash-object --no-filters`, which hashes the bytes on
# disk. Without a pinned rule, a contributor whose core.autocrlf differs from
# another's will see translation drift on files nobody edited, and a checker that
# cries wolf gets ignored. See ADR-sf-0006 and agents/i18n/TRANSLATION_PROTOCOL.md.
#
# Scoped to the harness on purpose. A repo-wide `*.md text eol=lf` would
# renormalize the original author's README files in the same change that hands
# him the repository.

AGENTS.md       text eol=lf
AGENTS.es.md    text eol=lf
agents/**/*.md  text eol=lf
agents/**/*.py  text eol=lf
